<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">记录与连接</view><view class="title">设备信息</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{status}}"><view class="card"><view class="kv"><text class="muted">终端名称</text><text>{{status.device_name}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">主控</text><text>玄铁 D121</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">从站</text><text>星火传感 / 龙芯系统</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">采集</text><text>{{status.collectingText}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">本地记录介质</text><text>{{status.storageText}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">最后收到数据</text><text>{{status.lastText}}</text></view></view><view class="section-title">云端记录服务</view><view class="card"><view class="kv"><text class="muted">后台接收</text><text>{{status.collector.connected?'已连接':'暂未连接'}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">历史保留</text><text>{{status.retention_days}} 天</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">上传中断判断</text><text>{{status.offline_seconds}} 秒无新数据</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">未能接收的报文</text><text>{{status.collector.dropped}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">历史写入失败</text><text>{{status.collector.write_errors || 0}} 次</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">后台状态检查失败</text><text>{{status.collector.observer_errors || 0}} 次</text></view><view wx:if="{{status.collector.error}}" class="notice">{{status.collector.error}}</view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{status.diagnostic}}"><view class="kv"><text class="muted">主站温度</text><text>{{status.diagnostic.chip_temperature}} ℃</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">星火记录写入错误</text><text>{{status.diagnostic.write_errors}} 次</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">通信应答超时</text><text>{{status.diagnostic.bus_timeouts}} 次</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="muted">通信校验错误</text><text>{{status.diagnostic.bus_crc_errors}} 次</text></view></view><view class="footer-note">“主站上传中断”表示云端没有收到新数据，不能直接判定主站已断电。后台服务自己的连接异常会单独显示。</view><button class="btn secondary" bindtap="logout">退出查看账号</button></view></view>
